<title>USA: Edgewood ISD, Texas, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Edgewood ISD, Texas, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $5 million of Edgewood Ind Sch Dist, Texas, school building Series 1997 general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.4772 percent.</p>
</text>
